            /// Declares a group of tests.
            /// - <c>test.describe(title, callback)</c>
            /// - <c>test.describe(callback)</c>
            /// - <c>test.describe(title, details, callback)</c>
            ///
            /// **Usage**
            ///
            /// You can declare a group of tests with a title. The title will be visible in the test report as a part of each
            /// test's title.
            ///
            /// <code lang="js">
            /// test.describe('two tests', () => {
            ///   test('one', async ({ page }) => {
            ///     // ...
            ///   });
            ///
