        /// [<c>path</c>](https://playwright.dev/docs/api/class-page#page-screenshot-option-path) is a relative path, then it is
        /// resolved relative to the current working directory. If no path is provided, the image won't be saved to the disk.
        /// </summary>
        member val path : string option = nativeOnly with get, set
        /// <summary>
        /// The quality of the image, between 0-100. Not applicable to <c>png</c> images. For <c>jpeg</c> the default is <c>80</c>. For
        /// <c>webp</c>, a quality of <c>100</c> (the default) produces a lossless image, while lower values use lossy compression.
        /// </summary>
